      Select any date and time to calculate the exact Eastern Standard Time equivalent. This interactive utility is fully daylight-saving aware, automatically switching to EST (UTC-5) or EDT (UTC-4) depending on the calendar date you select.
    </p>

    <!-- Custom Hero Illustration (SVG) -->
